The SPI-mode block driver (src/SdSpi.*), the FAT reader (src/Fat.*) and the
FAT image builder (tools/fatimg.py) are HypeRunner's clean-room code (MIT),
written from the SD Physical Layer Simplified Specification, the Microsoft
FAT specification, the MBR layout and the CH32X035 reference manual, with
no code from any other SD or FAT library. They reached CHSd by way of the
cuts CHWords (polled, read-only, single-block) and CHCrossword (folders and
name patterns) made of them, merged here.

